#
# The framebuffer node links to the firmware node, which links to the mailbox.
uses mailbox_v1 via device firmware, mboxes { property }
# In an image with the log server, the component's trace (its EDID and the mode
# it configures at start) goes to it on the interface's io-channel; elsewhere
# the import stays unlinked.
uses log_v1 via component log_server { flush }
